Package: lslearn
Title: Local Structure Learning for Causal DAGs
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Stephen", "Smith", , "stephensmith13424@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: In learning the structure of a causal DAG, users frequently want to focus
    on select target nodes to focus their efforts. The algorithms implemented in this package
    facilitate structure learning and edge orientation based on the local neighborhoods of
    select target nodes, as well as coordinate the information between the set of neighborhoods.
URL: https://github.com/stephenvsmith/lslearn,
  https://stephenvsmith.github.io/lslearn/
